      "writtenOn": "2023-04-20T00:21:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027re only allowing this to be set at the profile level at the moment per partner request. The BT stack is not going to manage context based switching because this becomes complicated when we consider BT classic.",
      "parentUuid": "f451eb8b_641acd33",
